# The public half of the Arbos update signing key (Ed25519, Sparkle
# `SUPublicEDKey` encoding). Compiled into the app: a payload installs only
# when its sparkle:edSignature verifies against this line. The private half
# is in the 1Password vault "Arbos" and in CI; it is never committed.
ed25519 j9n8EEb06cZGvCnSqJg4+gy4x63kLlwtxAe8NH7JLu0=
